		<div class="insight-post">
							<h3 class="insight-post__type">
					Report | 2025
				</h3>
						<h1 class="insight-post__title">Demand-Side Drivers of Steel Decarbonization: Automotive Procurement Practices</h1>
						<div class="insight-post__details">
														By
            <a href="https://rmi.org/people/shuyi-li/">Shuyi Li</a>,&nbsp;
            <a href="https://rmi.org/people/li-ting/">Ting Li</a>,&nbsp;
            <a href="https://rmi.org/people/wei-li/">Wei Li</a>&nbsp;
